2. The `n_chunks` path uses `df.get_chunk(0, chunk_size)` — `get_chunk` doesn't exist on the protocol DataFrame. The abstract class has `get_chunks(n_chunks)`. The original modin implementation of from_dataframe... Actually, in pandas' `from_dataframe._from_dataframe`:

